#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:5
#: 39051f97636e4f64a3524455bb9d9d29
msgid "Log Analysis Case Study: Turn Rate Adjustment"
msgstr "日志分析案例研究：转弯速率调整"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:7
#: 233b39c587614e93b67fa3857495d737
msgid ""
"Analyzing flight logs can help you diagnose problems with your missions. "
"This case study brings you an example of a flight where, by analyzing the "
"log data, our resident expert, Andrew Tridgell, suggested adjusting the turn"
" rate and increasing the maximum roll angle to correct the plane's failure "
"to reach a waypoint as a result of turning too slowly. The original forum "
"posts can be found `**here** "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-73-released?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A1264198>`__."
msgstr ""
"分析飞行日志可以帮助你诊断任务中的问题。本案例研究为你提供了一个飞行示例：通过分析日志数据，我们的驻场专家 Andrew Tridgell "
"建议调整转弯速率并增加最大横滚角，以纠正飞机因转弯太慢而无法到达航点的问题。原帖可在 ` **这里** "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-73-released?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A1264198>`_"
" _ 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:15
#: 1bddd5cb02464cfdaa25802213f0f143
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"DIY Drones member Vishnu posted these logs of his X8 plane using APM code "
"2.73. He described an issue with auto take off where his throttle was "
"maintaining 100% despite being set to 75%."
msgstr ""
"DIY Drones 成员 Vishnu 使用 APM 代码 2.73 发布了他的 X8 飞机的这些日志。他描述了自动起飞时油门保持 100% "
"的问题，尽管设置为 75%。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:19
#: ec945d0a35bc46fdb4ac239638c518fd
msgid ""
"5/26/2013 tlog file (803 KB) - Downloaded from original blog post \\ "
"`**here** "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-73-released?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A1264198>`__."
" - `x8 throttle slew rate 100 param file "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/x8throttleslewrate100.param>`__"
msgstr ""
"2013 年 5 月 26 日的 tlog 文件（803 KB）- 从原博客帖子 \\ ` **这里** "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-73-released?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A1264198>`_"
" _ 下载。- `x8 油门变化率 100 参数文件 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/x8throttleslewrate100.param>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:21
#: a3baee6ca5be470b9318c775b4a1d27b
msgid ""
"`Jakkur Auto take off and land text file "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/Jakkur-Auto-take-"
"off-and-land.txt>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Jakkur 自动起飞和降落文本文件 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/Jakkur-Auto-take-"
"off-and-land.txt>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:23
#: c5640e98cdb24266ab468cde8b827c4e
msgid ""
"By analyzing this data using :ref:`Mavgraph <mavproxy:mavproxy-mavgraph>`, "
"Tridge was able to provide the following insight."
msgstr ""
"通过使用 :ref:`Mavgraph <mavproxy:mavproxy-mavgraph>` 分析这些数据，Tridge 能够提供以下见解。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:26
#: 7ecf1ea9c69d482f93b863c40c156fbf
msgid "***May 29, 2013 DIYDrones; posted to Plane 2.x Software forum:***"
msgstr "***2013 年 5 月 29 日 DIYDrones；发布于 Plane 2.x 软件论坛：***"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:28
#: 24a7b05c278744c0aced5b0b5510c137
msgid ""
"\"I've taken a look at your logs, and the biggest problem is that the "
"RLL2SRV_P is not large enough and you have not given Plane enough authority "
"over the turn rate."
msgstr "「我看了你的日志，最大的问题是 RLL2SRV_P 不够大，而且你没有给 Plane 足够的转弯速率权限。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:32
#: 306cbd241ea8414aada4a8b24a1d7419
msgid "This is what your flight looked like:"
msgstr "这是你的飞行情况："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:37
#: 6e750ab831ee4fbe90a8178b0ce4333f
msgid ""
"You can see it did make the first waypoint, but then was turning much too "
"slowly for the second waypoint."
msgstr "你可以看到它确实到达了第一个航点，但随后转弯太慢，无法到达第二个航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:40
#: b31d3004081d467987f1a10d8d364e74
msgid ""
"Let's look at a graph of the nav_roll (the roll the plane wants to achieve) "
"and the actual roll. The red line represents the mission sequence number."
msgstr "让我们看看 nav_roll（飞机想要实现的横滚）和实际横滚的图表。红线代表任务序列号。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:47
#: 77bd204431644e3591a285e589ed55e4
msgid ""
"In the takeoff nav_roll is small, as its flight is straight ahead. It then "
"goes to -30 degrees, as that is the ROLL_LIMIT_DEG you have specified. The "
"problem is that the actual roll only goes to around -10 degrees. So the "
"plane is not achieving the roll that APM is asking for."
msgstr ""
"在起飞阶段，nav_roll 很小，因为飞行是直线前进的。然后它变为 -30 度，因为那是你设置的 "
"ROLL_LIMIT_DEG。问题在于实际横滚只达到了约 -10 度。所以飞机没有实现 APM 要求的横滚。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:52
#: ccd4e75753d348239a69af4b6e42f358
msgid "The reason for this is the RLL2SRV\\_\\* parameters you have chosen:"
msgstr "原因在于你选择的 RLL2SRV\\_\\* 参数："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:61
#: 2710bc7da61a49d8960d5cc37cf32db8
msgid ""
"You have specified zero I term and a quite small P term for an aircraft like"
" the X8. Let's have a look at the servo values that APM ended up using with "
"those settings:"
msgstr "你为像 X8 这样的飞机指定了零积分项和相当小的比例项。让我们看看 APM 用这些设置最终使用的舵机值："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:68
#: 2bc917b93f444cde8bc038b1b9cf24dc
msgid ""
"You can see that the APM was moving the first elevon only a small amount, "
"and the second elevon by about 150. Now let's compare that to what happened "
"when you switched to manual flight:"
msgstr "你可以看到，APM 只移动了第一个升降副翼很小的量，第二个升降副翼移动了约 150。现在让我们与你切换到手动飞行时发生的情况进行比较："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:75
#: 4ed27c83da3c4253a926051407c11436
msgid ""
"When you took manual control you rolled the plane left by 65 degrees. That "
"compares to a maximum roll angle that you have allowed the APM to use of 30 "
"degrees."
msgstr "当你接管手动控制时，你将飞机向左横滚了 65 度。相比之下，你允许 APM 使用的最大横滚角为 30 度。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:79
#: 04e3632eac384a268a99891b70bacb04
msgid ""
"You also used a lot more aileron movement than you have allowed the APM to "
"use. To roll the plane over you used almost full left aileron, whereas the "
"RLL2SRV_P gain of 0.4 with a 20 degree roll error only allowed the APM to "
"move the aileron by 0.4\\*(20/45)\\*500 which is 89. So you moved the "
"aileron more than 3 times as much as the APM did."
msgstr ""
"你使用的副翼量也远超你允许 APM 使用的量。为了将飞机滚转，你使用了几乎全左副翼，而 RLL2SRV_P 增益为 0.4、横滚误差 20 度时只允许 "
"APM 移动副翼 0.4\\*(20/45)\\*500，即 89。所以你移动副翼的幅度是 APM 的 3 倍以上。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:85
#: 256ecc12034d4f578134f9659d93abc7
msgid ""
"The X8 has quite a lot of natural stability, which also means it needs quite"
" a lot of elevon movement to get it to roll. If you only move the elevons a "
"small way it will not be able to overcome its natural stability, and also "
"won't overcome any wind, or slight trim errors."
msgstr ""
"X8 "
"有相当大的自然稳定性，这也意味着它需要相当大的升降副翼运动才能使其横滚。如果只移动升降副翼一点点，它将无法克服自然稳定性，也无法克服风或轻微的微调误差。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:90
#: eff1c459e4f042ff88a935a4fae0f2b1
msgid "To fix it you need to make the following changes:"
msgstr "要解决此问题，你需要进行以下更改："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:92
#: 84ffca27809b43839566cba0a9e73d5f
msgid "Double your RLL2SRV_P to 0.8, perhaps higher based on testing"
msgstr "将 RLL2SRV_P 翻倍至 0.8，根据测试可能需要更高"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:93
#: 693be3a9007b4d89b70198d00edafa67
msgid "Change RLL2SRV_I to 0.1"
msgstr "将 RLL2SRV_I 改为 0.1"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:94
#: aedb0a00650e4a488699ae9716790399
msgid "Change RLL2SRV_IMAX to 1500"
msgstr "将 RLL2SRV_IMAX 改为 1500"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:95
#: 8927a123c2724f65b4a487e7e6fdd5a7
msgid ""
"You also have a value for NAVL1_PERIOD which is too high for an X8. Change "
"it to 18."
msgstr "你的 NAVL1_PERIOD 值对于 X8 来说也太高了。将其更改为 18。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:98
#: b4ad848a368c418c875850f0a95b8829
msgid "Your airspeed also doesn't look well calibrated:"
msgstr "你的空速也看起来校准得不好："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-turn-rate.rst:103
#: d3e7e008ca1a492fa6df81202aad8a60
msgid ""
"Have you checked your sensor for leaks? It is aligned correctly and clear of"
" the airframe? The airspeed and ground speed should match on average when "
"you loiter. You may need to adjust ARSPD_RATIO to be a bit larger."
msgstr "你检查过传感器是否漏气吗？它的方向正确且远离机架吗？当你盘旋时，空速和地速平均应该匹配。你可能需要适当增大 ARSPD_RATIO。"
